# Professional Website (GitHub Pages)

A lightweight, markdown-driven personal website configured for deployment via GitHub Pages.

## Color Scheme Palette
- `#22223b` — Dark Slate Violet (Primary Backgrounds / Text)
- `#4a4e69` — Slate Blue (Brand Primary / Headings)
- `#9a8c98` — Muted Mauve (Accents / Highlights)
- `#c9ada7` — Soft Rose (Secondary Accents / Borders)
- `#f2e9e4` — Light Cream (Main Background / Light Text)

## Local Setup
1. Clone the repository:
   ```bash
   git clone [https://github.com/your-username/your-repo-name.git](https://github.com/your-username/your-repo-name.git)
